-# "Ratenplan": the installments of the plan in effect -- the person's
-# individual plan, else the standard plan of the role -- and how they are
-# paid, for everybody who sees the page (the person included). With the
-# privileged view (fee_page_privileged?: :log on the person, or the finance
-# audit tier) -- in the list, its own access -- also its issue, a planned plan
-# and the plans that were active;
-# the comments need :log on accounting entries (audit tier); planning,
-# activating and discarding need :update_finance
-# (Person::InstallmentsController).
-#
-# Saving, activating and discarding answer with a page refresh that morphs the
-# page and keeps the scroll position, so the section stays where it is; their
-# notice shows here, not at the top.
-#
-# context: :person (default) on the person's Beitrag page, with the heading;
-# :fin inside a row of the Individuelle Ratenpläne list
-# (fin/individual_payment_plans), without it. Both offer the buttons and the
-# form: every section has its own place for them (installments_actions_id)
-# and its own notice.
- context = local_assigns.fetch(:context, :person)
- on_person_page = context == :person
- privileged = !on_person_page || fee_page_privileged?(person)
- show_comment = can?(:log, AccountingEntry)
- may_change = can?(:update_finance, person)
- individual = person.wsjrdp_raw_installments_eur.present?
- planned = person.planned_fee_rule
- planned = nil unless planned&.custom_installments_plan?

-# The anchor #payment_plan_<id> (payment_plan_anchor): unique also where the
-# sections of several people share a page.
%section.installments{id: payment_plan_anchor(person), class: on_person_page ? "mt-3" : "mt-1"}
  - if on_person_page
    - if person.early_payer && !individual
      %h2.mt-3.mb-3 Kein Ratenplan - Einmalzahler
    - else
      %h2.mt-3.mb-3 Ratenplan
  - if (notice = installments_notice(person)).present?
    .alert.alert-success.py-1.px-2.mb-2= notice
  %table.table.table-striped.table-sm.table-custom
    %thead
      %tr
        %th(style="text-align: right;") Zeitpunkt
        %th.text-end Betrag
        %th.text-end Soll Kontostand
    %tbody
      - installments_table_entries(person).each do |entry|
        %tr
          %td(style="text-align: right;")= entry[:date]
          %td.text-end= entry[:amount]
          %td.text-end= entry[:total]
  %div
    Zahlungsart: #{installments_payment_method_label(person)}
  - if privileged && individual
    - if person.wsjrdp_installments_issue.present?
      %div
        Vorgang:
        = auto_link_escaped_multiline(person.wsjrdp_installments_issue)
    - if show_comment && person.wsjrdp_installments_comment.present?
      .installments-comment.fw-light.fst-italic
        = auto_link_escaped_multiline(person.wsjrdp_installments_comment)

  - if privileged && planned
    .alert.alert-warning.mt-2.mb-2.py-2
      %div
        Geplant: #{installments_text(planned.yme_list) || "keine Raten"}
      .small= installments_rule_facts(planned)
      - if show_comment && planned.custom_installments_comment.present?
        .installments-comment.fw-light.fst-italic
          = auto_link_escaped_multiline(planned.custom_installments_comment)
      = installments_planned_sum_note(person, planned)

  -# The buttons, or the plan's form in their place (Turbo streams of
  -# Person::InstallmentsController, targeting installments_actions_id). No
  -# turbo frame: a frame that showed the form keeps the form's URL as src, and
  -# a page refresh that morphs the page would load it again.
  - if may_change
    %div{id: installments_actions_id(person)}
      = render "person/installments/buttons", person: person, context: on_person_page ? "person" : "fin"

  -# The plans that were active, newest first; nothing at all without any.
  - if privileged && (history = person.participation_fee.installments_history.to_a).any?
    %h4.mt-3 Änderungen am Ratenplan
    - history.each do |rule|
      .mt-2
        .muted.small= installments_history_header(rule)
        %div= installments_text(rule.yme_list) || "keine Raten"
        .small= installments_rule_facts(rule)
        - if show_comment && rule.custom_installments_comment.present?
          .installments-comment.fw-light.fst-italic
            = auto_link_escaped_multiline(rule.custom_installments_comment)
